msgid "Next steps {#next-steps}"
msgstr "Langkah selanjutnya {#next-steps}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Recommendations\">\n"
"- Rerun the experiment with and without the `slow_gates_ac` calibration (Step 2.1), the refreshed device properties (Step 2.2), or session calibration (Step 4.1) to measure how much each tool improves the results for your workload.\n"
"- Try a cheaper error mitigation method such as zero-noise extrapolation (ZNE), and use local simulation and dry-run usage estimates to compare its cost and accuracy with those of PEC. The [`select-error-mitigation`](https://github.com/Qiskit/skills) AI agent skill can help you make this choice.\n"
"- Explore the full characterization suite, including randomized benchmarking, in the [Refresh backend properties with real-time benchmarking](/tutorials/refresh-backend-properties-with-real-time-benchmarking) tutorial.\n"
"- Learn more about the client-side primitives and the Executor in [Migrate from server-side to client-side Sampler and Estimator](/guides/migrate-to-client-side-primitives).\n"
"- Apply these tools to your own experiments. Start with the tools that address your largest source of uncertainty, such as device quality, noise, cost, or execution timing.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Rekomendasi\">\n"
"- Jalankan ulang eksperimen dengan dan tanpa kalibrasi `slow_gates_ac` (Langkah 2.1), properti perangkat yang disegarkan (Langkah 2.2), atau kalibrasi session (Langkah 4.1) untuk mengukur seberapa besar tiap alat memperbaiki hasil untuk workload kamu.\n"
"- Coba metode error mitigation yang lebih murah seperti zero-noise extrapolation (ZNE), dan pakai simulasi lokal serta estimasi penggunaan dry-run untuk membandingkan biaya dan akurasinya dengan PEC. Skill agen AI [`select-error-mitigation`](https://github.com/Qiskit/skills) bisa membantu kamu memilih.\n"
"- Jelajahi seluruh suite karakterisasi, termasuk randomized benchmarking, di tutorial [Refresh backend properties with real-time benchmarking](/tutorials/refresh-backend-properties-with-real-time-benchmarking).\n"
"- Pelajari lebih lanjut tentang primitive sisi klien dan Executor di [Migrate from server-side to client-side Sampler and Estimator](/guides/migrate-to-client-side-primitives).\n"
"- Terapkan alat-alat ini pada eksperimen kamu sendiri. Mulai dari alat yang menangani sumber ketidakpastian terbesar kamu, seperti kualitas perangkat, noise, biaya, atau timing eksekusi.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

